{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123845","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123845/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123845/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123845/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123845","id":5590076915,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFMz2UQ","number":123845,"title":"Disable looping on `AudioStreamWAV` preview generation","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-26T00:39:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T16:57:25Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123845","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123845","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123845.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123845.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe `AudioStream` preview generator takes the loop mode into account and may generate a broken waveform.\r\n\r\nThis is what an audio waveform usually looks when loop is disabled:\r\n<img width=\"280\" height=\"343\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6fa34803-3775-416c-8fde-c849c7796bf0\" />\r\n\r\nNow let's play around with **Backward** loop mode and Loop End set to 1/4 of the file (you need to reopen the engine after reimporting as it doesn't update, to be fixed by #123820):\r\n<img width=\"283\" height=\"342\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69f6a05e-8820-4bdb-8e95-3343f03585c6\" />\r\n\r\nThis should **not** happen. The waveform is meant to show from beginning to end, not how it will be played, and the piece in charge of demonstrating the loop is the playback cursor, which starts at that point and returns to the beginning.\r\n\r\nI modified the preview generator so `AudioStreamPlaybackWAV` will always have looping disabled, thus making the waveform correct:\r\n<img width=\"278\" height=\"338\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8a3776f-625d-42d8-ba5d-ad3719dcd9b6\" />\r\n\r\nLoop playback still works as usual. This is just meant to fix the preview waveform.\r\n\r\nThis should not be a problem for MP3 or Ogg Vorbis as their streams don't have a Loop End or backwards playback.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nHere is the project used to make the demonstrations above, which takes an audio file from the TPS demo: [preview_sample_project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32675905/preview_sample_project.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\nNo AI used.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123845/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123845/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}